<title>FRANCE: Arafat arrives in France for Chirac talks.</title>
<headline>Arafat arrives in France for Chirac talks.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Palestinian President Yasser Arafat arrived in Paris on Friday to brief President Jacques Chirac on the outcome of the Middle East summit in Washington this week.</p>
<p>Arafat's jet arrived at Orly airport from Italy, where he met Prime Minister Romano Prodi and Foreign Minister Lamberto Dini in Naples. He was expected to leave France later on Friday night.</p>
</text>
